      "location": {
        "known": true,
        "value": "The Octopus Head Helm can be obtained by killing Land Octopuses (Not to be confused with Giant Land Octopuses ). Twelve Land Octopuses can be found South of Saintsbridge Site of Grace [ Map Link ], in a small lake close to Iron Fist Alexander 's first encounter. A few Land Octopuses can be found South-West of the Temple Quarter Site of Grace in Liurnia of the Lakes . North of the Siofra River Bank Site of Grace , near the large pillar on the map, there are several Giant Land Octopuses , and many of the smaller Land Octopuses.",
